  "title": "Princess",
  "description": "A few years after their graduation from Princeton, Louis Baxter's friend William comes to stay with him and his wife in their new home on the island of Ithaca and they take him along to the island's weirdest society event, the annual endangered animals benefit. To raise more money this year, a single dinner with the Princess Ithaca is auctioned off, and William bids on it. He wins, but falls for Princess Ithaca, who believes him to be the seeker, a long-awaited savior for the castle's greatest secret, that magical creatures are real and it's Princess Ithaca's job to protect and heal them, but only till her 21st birthday. Now with time running out, he has to help the princess find the girl meant to be her successor before she loses her abilities and the successor looses her chance to be princess forever.",
